@ Start

? if: {melodia_dawn_granted} == on

  - Dawn Chorus
    The veil already rests with you. Morning will find you where you left it.

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_q_echo_03_complete} == on

    - Dawn Chorus
      You walked the cadence home without losing a single step of it. That is how light returns.

    - Dawn Chorus
      Wear this veil of the first dawn, so the road ahead always begins gently.

    $ melodia_dawn_granted = on
    $ Notify melodia:reward:melodia_reward_dawn_veil
    $ Notify melodia:stat:reunion_dawn:melodia_harmony:1

  ? else:

    - Dawn Chorus
      The first dawn is still gathering. It will break when the grove's story completes its turn.

  ? endif

? endif

$ End
